{"4337020":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Amanecer","steam_appid":4337020,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amanecer<\/strong> is a 2D psychological horror game designed to deliver a brief yet intense experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young boy wakes up in a strange house, with no memory of who he is or how he got there. To uncover the truth, he must explore unsettling environments, solve puzzles, and collect letters and clues that piece together fragments of the story.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative exploration:<\/strong> Wander through eerie rooms filled with secrets and hidden details.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles:<\/strong> Unlock doors, activate mechanisms, and overcome logical challenges to progress.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item collection:<\/strong> Gather letters and symbolic objects that reconstruct the protagonist’s past.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression:<\/strong> Each discovery brings the boy closer to understanding why he is trapped and how to escape.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive atmosphere:<\/strong> Minimalist pixel art and haunting silence reinforce the psychological tension.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Amanecer<\/i> invites players to embark on an emotional journey where every clue reveals a new piece of the mystery, and every step leads closer to the final revelation.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amanecer<\/strong> is a 2D psychological horror game designed to deliver a brief yet intense experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young boy wakes up in a strange house, with no memory of who he is or how he got there. To uncover the truth, he must explore unsettling environments, solve puzzles, and collect letters an